      <span class="acf-page-lead__type usa-tag text-uppercase">
                  Federal Plans
              </span>
    </div>
  
      <h1 class="acf-page-lead__title text-primary-dark">Post-Disaster Reunification of Children: A Nationwide Approach</h1>
  
  
      <div class="acf-page-lead__summary usa-prose">
      Whole community collaboration &amp; emergency planning to reunify children separated from parents or legal guardians in the event of large disasters. Working together to assist local, state, tribal, territorial, and insular area governments and those responsible for the temporary care of children.
    </div>
  </div>

<div class="acf-page-lead__divider border-top-1px border-base-light margin-top-2 margin-bottom-4" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      
      
