      <article about="/ohsepr/policy-guidance/post-disaster-reunification-children-nationwide-approach" class="acf-policy-guidance-node">

  <div class="acf-policy-guidance-node__content">
          <section class="acf-policy-guidance-node__body usa-prose margin-bottom-4">
        
            <div class="text-long wysiwyg"><p>Children can become separated from their parents or caregivers during an emergency. This document supports efforts to reunify unaccompanied minors and separated or missing children with their parents or legal guardians in the aftermath of a disaster.&nbsp;</p></div>
      
      </section>
    
    
          <section class="acf-policy-guidance-node__files margin-top-4">
          
